00:05:50.008 --> 00:05:53.287
Speaker 1: either. And Microsoft Planner is aggressively expanding.

95
00:05:53.287 --> 00:05:54.225
Speaker 2: Oh, massively expanding.

96
00:05:54.225 --> 00:05:59.496
