123
00:07:33.557 --> 00:07:37.306
Speaker 1: So high-level strategy and low-level task management all mixed together.

124
00:07:37.306 --> 00:07:45.338
Speaker 2: Exactly. But the new architecture totally rejects that dual purpose. Planner Premium is engineered explicitly—and

125
00:07:45.338 --> 00:07:48.551
